    <dashboard name='Story 1' type='storyboard'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Global Insights: Wealth, Health &amp; Energy&quot;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='width' value='260' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1500' minheight='800' minwidth='1500' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98934' x='533' y='1000'>
            <zone h='5000' id='3' type-v2='title' w='98934' x='533' y='1000' />
            <zone h='12625' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98934' x='533' y='6000' />
            <zone h='80375' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98934' x='533' y='18625'>
              <flipboard active-id='4' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='The Global Economic Divide' captured-sheet='Dashboard 1' id='1'>
                    <capturedDeltas>
                      <worksheet name='Top 10 Countries Ranking'>
                        <style delta-type='added'>
                          <style-rule element='axis'>
                            <encoding attr='space' class='0' field='[federated.06402ww0n8ree01fx4gzj078nc98].[sum:Calculation_0099011834437634:qk]' field-type='quantitative' max='1964518211974.7258' min='-77002196449.738068' range-type='fixed' scope='cols' type='space' />
                          </style-rule>
                        </style>
                      </worksheet>
                    </capturedDeltas>
                  </story-point>
                  <story-point caption='Does Money Buy Life Expectancy?' captured-sheet='Dashboard 2' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='Energy &amp; Infrastructure' captured-sheet='Dashboard 3' id='3' />
                  <story-point caption='Summary Card' captured-sheet='' id='4' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='21750' hidden='true' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='43200' x='65933' y='4000'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>&quot;Global wealth is heavily concentrated in high-income nations like Luxembourg and the US. Industrial leaders like Germany keep massive trade surpluses, while top consumers run high trade deficits.&quot;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='18125' hidden='true' id='7' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='33333' x='70467' y='4250'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Higher GDP per capita boosts life expectancy and drops child mortality quickly. However, gains level off at higher incomes, while low-income nations still face high fertility and mortality rates.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='18125' hidden='true' id='8' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='33333' x='77867' y='7375'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Saudi Arabia, Russia, and the US lead global oil output, with the US and Russia dominating natural gas. Meanwhile, large economies (US, China, India) build massive highway networks to support trade.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='85625' id='9' story-point-id='4' type-v2='text' w='98600' x='200' y='17750'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Key Findings &amp; Strategic Summary</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Healthcare &amp; Living Standards:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'> Investing directly in primary healthcare and basic living conditions within low-income nations yields the highest global gains in life expectancy while rapidly driving down child mortality rates.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Energy Transition &amp; Sustainability:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'> Major economic powerhouses and top consumer nations face an urgent need to transition toward renewable energy sources to reduce heavy dependence on fossil fuels and stabilize global market prices.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Infrastructure &amp; Trade Backbone:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'> Modernizing transport networks and expanding digital infrastructure remain the primary drivers of cross-border trade efficiency, connecting regional markets to the global economy.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Socioeconomic Policy Guidance:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'> Sustainable economic development requires a balanced strategy—pairing capital investment in physical infrastructure with continuous development of human capital and social welfare systems.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{3744B6BD-14FC-4846-AA51-2E9DDAD13656}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
